infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Two migrations, one codebase
  desc Big-bang rewrite vs route-by-route — same team, opposite outcomes
  compares
    - label Big-bang rewrite
      children
        - label 6-week plan, whole team
          desc One long-lived branch, app-router-v2
        - label Month 4: 400 commits behind main
          desc Diverges faster than it migrates
        - label Month 5: branch abandoned
          desc Dead NProgress, FOUC, expiring sessions
        - label Cost: a quarter of roadmap
          desc Zero shipped value
    - label Route-by-route migration
      children
        - label Both routers in one build
          desc Conflict error: one URL, one router
        - label First route: 2-3 weeks
          desc Carries layout, registry, auth relocation
        - label ~2 routes / engineer-week
          desc Every PR ships to production
        - label 3 quarters, no release freeze
          desc Burn-down: routes left in pages/ to zero
theme
  palette #f43f5e #14b8a6
